# Device evidence and screen recordings dropped at the repository root. They are client
# material and private diagnostic captures: `vercel deploy` uploads the working directory,
# so without these five lines an ordinary deploy publishes them. Production imagery lives
# under `public/`, so nothing legitimate matches at the root.
/*.jpeg
/*.jpg
/*.png
/*.mp4
/*.mov
